<h2><span>Info</span></h2>
</div>
<hr />
<div class="credit first">
<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--code/info%3Astyle/3" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>Social Life</strong><br />
<strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/literallymechanical" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2829014); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2829014&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608860911" alt="LiterallyMechanical" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2829014)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/literallymechanical" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2829014); return false;">LiterallyMechanical</a></span><br />
For the rest of my work, check out <a href="/literallymechanical-s-author-page">LiterallyMechanical's Author Page</a></p>
<p>A few of my favorites:</p>
<ul>
